  "slug": "candidate-interview-evaluation-form",
  "title": "Candidate Interview Evaluation Form",
  "subtitle": "Use this evaluation to apply explicit criteria to traceable evidence, calibrate the conclusion, authorize action, and preserve limitations for a candidate interview workflow.",
  "description": "An original operational candidate interview evaluation form that controls a interview stage and candidate record from identity and routing through evidence, qualified decision, exception management, implementation, handoff, and final verification.",
  "use_case": "Use when the recruiting coordinator or interview lead needs a traceable evaluation so the qualified recruiting or HR reviewer can advance, hold, decline, reschedule, or obtain additional job-related evidence under the approved requisition, structured interview plan, privacy rules, and applicable equal-employment requirements without relying on an informal email, spreadsheet, or unreviewed narrative.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
